    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220430/extras/de221f7c78c03b426e6503c50275e2a3.avif?t=1754446854\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious, unforgiving,  atmospheric and intriguing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive on-rails quick time cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice based mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked doors, secrets and choice variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaustion mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Written story and sound design tailored specifically for this game.<br><br><br>No turning back. No second chances. <br>One chance for each playthrough.<br><br>5 Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Mode: Randomized Permadeath Gameplay Mode<br>Linear Story Mode: Linear order story progression\u00a0<br>Quick Time Mode: Linear Quick-Time-On-rails Mode with Save State<br>  Marathon Mode:\u00a0Linear Quick-Time-On-rails Mode with permadeath<br>Puzzle Mode: Search puzzle marathon mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220430/extras/de221f7c78c03b426e6503c50275e2a3.avif?t=1754446854\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious, unforgiving,  atmospheric and intriguing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive on-rails quick time cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice based mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked doors, secrets and choice variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaustion mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Written story and sound design tailored specifically for this game.<br><br><br>No turning back. No second chances. <br>One chance for each playthrough.<br><br>5 Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Mode: Randomized Permadeath Gameplay Mode<br>Linear Story Mode: Linear order story progression\u00a0<br>Quick Time Mode: Linear Quick-Time-On-rails Mode with Save State<br>  Marathon Mode:\u00a0Linear Quick-Time-On-rails Mode with permadeath<br>Puzzle Mode: Search puzzle marathon mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
